  "expectation_basis": "All three CN and QCP variants: initialized forward, uninitialized forward, uninitialized reverse. Zero length allowed only in forward entries; reverse requires n>0. Initial concrete char values use shared signed/unsigned portable range 0..127; uninitialized storage has no claimed scalar bytes. Body zeroes all cells, while each archived post guarantees initialized ownership only; no stronger zero-array verification is claimed. Loop lengths stay below executor unroll limit. Legacy absolute strategy locator must resolve to the byte-identical archived logical strategy through a temporary, logged compatibility wrapper; immutable QCP source is not edited."
